[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_ffkkf")
dialogue_id = "debate_talisman_ring"
record_title = "Debate Speech: The Talismans"
text = "PAGE: scribe(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
scribe: Many people today look at our customs as thoughtless imitation.
scribe: They think we are children following arbitrary rules.
scribe: But let us examine the humble copper rings that so many of us wear.
scribe: Generations ago, the Enlightened One instructed our ancestors to forge these rings.
scribe: For centuries, we have worn them as a symbol of our unbroken lineage.
scribe: Recently, our scholars and healers have begun to study the hidden properties of metals.
scribe: They have discovered that copper repels the unseen corruption that spoils our water and festers in our wounds.
scribe: Our ancestors who wore those rings while tending their injuries survived fevers that claimed others.
scribe: They did not need to understand why the rings were important.
scribe: They only needed to follow the divine wisdom.
scribe: We can study the world to comprehend the machinery of miracles, without rejecting the ones we cannot yet explain.
scribe: Faith is the candle we carry to push away the dark, until our knowledge is bright enough to dispel it."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
